OL,3,GNEWSAFree sessions to help families
OL,4,Anavigate SEND system
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaw students at a university are
OL,7,Foffering free sessions to help families
OL,8,Funderstand the rights of children with
OL,9,FSpecial Educational Needs and
OL,10,FDisabilities (SEND).
OL,12,FNorthumbria University's student law
OL,13,Foffice is launching SEND Decoded to
OL,14,Fgive families information on what to
OL,15,Fexpect when seeking help and what the
OL,16,Flaw requires.
OL,18,FThey will hold two sessions, one at its
OL,19,FNewcastle campus on 18 November and one
OL,20,Fonline the following day. All materials
OL,21,Fare prepared and approved by specialist
OL,22,FSEND lawyers.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
